1. JavaScript String

A String in JavaScript is a sequence of characters used to store and work with text, such as names, messages, addresses, and sentences.

Hindi-
JavaScript में String characters का एक sequence होता है जिसका उपयोग text को store और process करने के लिए किया जाता है, जैसे name, message, address आदि।

Example
let name = "ankit";
let message = "Hello JavaScript";

console.log(name);
console.log(message);
Output:ankit
Hello JavaScript

