4. Template String / Template Literal

A Template Literal is a string created using backticks that allows variable interpolation, expressions, and multiline strings.

Hindi -Template Literal ऐसी String है जो backtick ` से बनाई जाती है। इसमें हम variable, expression और multiple lines आसानी से use कर सकते हैं।

Syntax
`text ${variable}`

Practical Code
let name = "ankit";
let age = 21;

let result = `My name is ${name} and my age is ${age}.`;

console.log(result);
Output: My name is ankit and my age is 21.

