| `\t`             | Tab             | Tab space         |
| `\b`             | Backspace       | एक character पीछे |
| `\f`             | Form feed       | Form feed         |
| `\r`             | Carriage return | Carriage return   |
| `\v`             | Vertical tab    | Vertical tab      |
| `\0`             | Null character  | Null character    |

