12. HTML Template Using Interpolation

An HTML Template uses template literals and interpolation to create HTML content dynamically using JavaScript variables and data.

Hindi - JavaScript में Template Literal + Interpolation की मदद से HTML को dynamically create करना HTML Template कहलाता है।

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>HTML Template</title>
</head>

<body>

<div id="app"></div>

<script>

let header = "Student List";

let students = [
    "ankit",
    "Rahul",
    "Aman",
    "Vikas"
];

let html = `
    <h2>${header}</h2>
    <ul>
`;

for (let x of students) {

    html += `
        <li>${x}</li>
    `;

}

html += `
    </ul>
`;

document.getElementById("app").innerHTML = html;

</script>

</body>
