13. Important Point — Strings are Immutable

JavaScript strings are immutable, which means their original characters cannot be changed directly. String methods generally return a new string.

Hindi -String immutable होती है, अर्थात original String को directly change नहीं किया जा सकता। Methods generally एक नई String return करते हैं।

Example
let str = "hello";
str.toUpperCase();
console.log(str);
Output: hello

//after result store 

let str = "hello";
str = str.toUpperCase();
console.log(str);

Output: HELLO

